{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "4710cebcb853c6148fdfeca63458f54c4781f86de06ce22d34f8adcbfd63dbb5", "ja": "挑戦は続く！", "zh": "挑战仍在继续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b4c722cf1e81681b1b48d1a01993223f9e127312d22c5002d69e2fa700cbc50c", "ja": "第五幕は満員御礼の大盛況！今回は皆の希望\nで、打ち上げの代わりに買い物をする事に。\n歩の提案で、普段あまり着た事がないファッ\nションに挑戦する事を決めるメンバー。\nどんなコーデがいいかを楽しそうに話す。", "zh": "第五幕演出盛况空前，感谢大家满场支持！这次应大家的希望，决定用购物代替庆功宴。在步的提议下，成员们决定挑战平时不太会穿的时尚风格，兴致勃勃地聊着该搭配什么样的造型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "d9588bd1507ae21834b9e845e52824f2737521c6aa5adbe41ba17244cdd2fa7e", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第五幕が終了。事前に受けた\nインタビューの反響もあり、満員御礼の大盛況だった）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第五幕结束了。由于事先接受的采访引起了反响，现场盛况空前，座无虚席）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ab7d0e60f225afbc7fe9612d70716e03f13986c7e74940d71d103817f9a387a3", "ja": "（今日はその打ち上げだが……みんなが「食事より\n買い物に行きたい」と言うので、付き合う事になった）", "zh": "（今天本来是庆功宴……不过大家都说比起吃饭更想去购物，所以我只好陪她们一起去了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "8607c5cdad54a0e62d441e6b9ee4176b31e4fd4a5638db921e7f9133cd8395bd", "ja": "私、今日めーっちゃ楽しみにしててん♪\nテンションあがってきたわ～！", "zh": "我今天可是超级期待的哦♪\n心情越来越好啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d6d2e3e0dde703ffe9e7acd7b66e309011fda2d27b94fdeb2fff5c444a2b25c1", "ja": "アタシ、ちょうど秋物のアウターが\n欲しかったんだよね～。", "zh": "我正好想买件秋装外套来着～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "ccebb33a53e1a49014e6eb2dcfc32735d1554775fde7f65f65e8c555da00f2df", "ja": "アウターもええなぁ！　や～、好きな物なんでも\n買うてもらえるなんて、ホンマ夢みたいやなぁ♪", "zh": "外套也不错嘛！呀～喜欢的东西想买什么就有人买给我，简直像做梦一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1005_p", "source_sha256": "87b16892e5eaddfef46ef2d1a32f8bbc5543d56b629a31336e3b7b55a0d5ab2b", "ja": "舞台の成功は、みんなの努力あっての事だからな。\nこれくらいはお安い御用だ！", "zh": "舞台的成功是靠大家共同努力换来的嘛。这点小事不在话下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ab2fe3c294c779794ea8068f03680e0f868b8a855db98c8ee3c4e9a2bf9c146d", "ja": "とはいえ、予算の上限はあるけど……\n何に使うかは、みんなに任せるよ。", "zh": "不过，预算还是有上限的……\n至于要用在哪里，就交给大家决定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "00b178b8d18ef41d745cd042e0bbf34f48df3f20a212c7bbdc4ef2c94b4e4962", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nありがとう、ございます……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……谢谢您……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "c5ba22e0ba8f7aca5c5b09356bf5e89a819b15e51585e665560a252951055357", "ja": "{$P$}さん、太っ腹ですな～。\nけど、本当にいいんでしょうか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，真大方呢～。\n不过，真的可以吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "032889ea4b8fd48c025052c3383e96eafafad19dbdd34b0d5ddb1a4ecd314ce4", "ja": "今回のMVPが何言うてんねん！　主演の美也が\n一番ワガママ言わんくて、どないするん？", "zh": "这次的MVP说什么呢！饰演主角的美也要是不任性一点，那可怎么办啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "19bf173e6c73180d68817c8fe42f0bdf5d11f9ec8489d05db941b5fc05e524b4", "ja": "ん……。今回の、お芝居……\nみんな、びっくりしてた……ね……。", "zh": "嗯……这次的演出……大家都吓了一跳……呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "595219016af2244eadd550d2e8e067d23b21e89f793e9305d0006c31db76937d", "ja": "そうですね～。私も、ここまで反響があるとは\n思いませんでした～。挑戦した甲斐がありましたよ～。", "zh": "是啊～我也没想到会引起这么大的反响～看来挑战一番还是值得的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b2d25105148a49504328c8e7f9a3fba7337525cd63e1b7ca67cc2f81b4fc4275", "ja": "挑戦かぁ……なるほどね。\nだったら、せっかくだしさ……。", "zh": "挑战啊……原来如此。既然这样，机会难得嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8733e0e6fae5760f12d2c1557a159240043a031988923e350a515daada850576", "ja": "みんな、今までとは違うファッションに\n挑戦してみない？", "zh": "大家要不要挑战一下与以往不同的时尚风格？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "26339636fac06faee552b037e96652cea98638185334f67172f80900d6183cd8", "ja": "違うファッション……なるほど。\n新しい可能性を探る感じか。", "zh": "不同的时尚……原来如此。感觉是在探索新的可能性啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "d92c3b60891aa81468dc463a4bb5eba7b1debfd84f333a99809af606df366ea5", "ja": "そう！　例えば美也だったら、\nスポーティなものを取り入れてみるとか。どう？", "zh": "对！比如美也的话，可以试着融入一些运动风元素。怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "85f567b21bda0aa60033a881ea18997efaf4bf546eb39f6a819407e2a20ae282", "ja": "スポーティ……。\nたしかに、普段は着ませんね～……。", "zh": "运动风……。\n确实，我平时不怎么穿呢～……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "f6782a6e8f70c46e7f7dbaee033c4d6a3bcbc97d93ba5e596f63df2fbf1d49d0", "ja": "ここでも挑戦とは……望むところですよ～。\n歩さん、お願いしてもいいですか～？", "zh": "在这里挑战吗……正合我意哦～  \n步，可以拜托你吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8361c8fdd122d3b0f7133938dccd2b028e90246895d4baeae367adb95d885035", "ja": "OK！ 今まで見たことがないくらい、\nカッコイイ美也にしてみせるよ！", "zh": "OK！包在我身上，绝对会把你打造成\n前所未有的超帅气美也！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "9c0e1c6bca91cc2410a25a4d7b12848279a91f1458e0700ae9a9c2c63fa9a2b5", "ja": "めっちゃええやん！　ほな、杏奈は……\nストリート系の、ビッグシルエットとか？", "zh": "太棒了！那杏奈的话……\n街头风的宽大版型怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "57e569223718696fda4c5de3aa8260cfc119e060c74d516407a2faf57c3c6629", "ja": "ストリート系……わからない、けど……。\nあ、でも……。", "zh": "街头风……我不太懂，不过……\n啊，但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "3812d7db78a6258e7b9c0cd71e0900bdb0e91904bc71d6fc735f6b7826df2305", "ja": "杏奈も……挑戦、したいから……。\n奈緒さん、教えてほしい……です……。", "zh": "杏奈也……想挑战一下……。\n奈绪姐，希望你教教我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1022_037nao", "source_sha256": "65797b5caf77597b4226df363877af0dcad38f6ab792481706ca788d62b12993", "ja": "まかしとき！　歩と私がおるんやから、\n完璧なコーデを約束したるわ！", "zh": "包在我身上！有步和我在这儿，\n绝对给你挑一套最完美的搭配！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1023_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f80eb8018a702f8a51756439641f62af18cbeaa144d92088347f8e8e4f4ae6ff", "ja": "腕が鳴るな～♪　あっ、でも自分たちの\n買い物もしなきゃだから……。", "zh": "真是让人跃跃欲试呢～♪　啊，不过我们还得买自己的东西……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1024_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e01fb3e30320be89f41fbd40637d54a0f7dfaaff4dca144cc251d8951665482a", "ja": "こうしちゃいられない！\nみんな、今すぐお店を見に行こう！", "zh": "不能再这样下去了！\n大家，现在马上去看看店里吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "05b030543d1d2b34c5d5534f463bb11848506eb5bba7a92d64bf5d88863b7088", "ja": "（この『STARDOM ROAD』公演自体が、\n挑戦そのものでもある……）", "zh": "（这场《STARDOM ROAD》公演本身，就是一种挑战……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0349_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0349_story_07_1026_p", "source_sha256": "75e37d2740ff1975785cf0d4233b28fad6a3f67b53d1a3b625c930ee2553c2d5", "ja": "（次なる挑戦はもう目の前……第六幕に向けて、\n一層の気合いを入れないとな！）", "zh": "（下一个挑战已经近在眼前……为了第六幕，得再鼓足干劲才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
